      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/342-one-wcs; regenerate the shell snapshots\n\nThe only conflicts were the three shell snapshot goldens. Regenerated on\nthe merged tree (UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1 from crates/ui): the six G54-G59 rows\nbecome one 'WCS G54' row and the height chip reads '(WCS G54 +0.00)';\nnothing else moved. Full ui lib 297 passed; app one_wcs, setup_wcs,\nsetup_defines_wcs, setups, posting, project_roundtrip, golden_cl,\nplane_align, setup_align pass; clippy -D warnings clean.\n\nRefs #342, #365\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
